  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed annex is of a size and layout that has the appearance of a self contained unit with all the primary functions of a self contained dwelling present kitchen, family area, separate bedroom and bathroom and independent access via the rear access road and gate with plot easily divisible. As such the LPA considers that the proposed development would not be incidental or ancillary to the primary use of the site a self contained residential dwelling house. The proposal is therefore contrary to  policy D3 of the London Plan 2021, Policies DM10 and DM11 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012. and Kingston Residential Design SPD (2013) Policy 41.",
    "By reason of layout and siting the proposed development would potentially impact the amenities of No. 140 and 144 Bridge Road and No.143, 145 and 147 Compton Crescent by reason of noise from users of the outbuilding accessing the main house to access communal facilities, as such the proposed development is contrary to Paragraph 135 of the NPPF 2024, Policies D3 of the London Plan 2021 and Policies CS8, DM10 of the Council's Core Strategy 2012."
